{"speciesId":235,"names":{"fr":"Queulorior","es":"Smeargle","en":"Smeargle","ja":"ドーブル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"A special fluid oozes from the tip of its tail. It paints the fluid everywhere to mark its territory."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Once it becomes an adult, it has a tendency to let its comrades plant footprints on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The color of the mysterious fluid secreted from its tail is predeter­ mined for each SMEARGLE."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SMEARGLE marks the boundaries of its territory using a body fluid that leaks out from the tip of its tail. Over 5,000 different marks left by this POKéMON have been found."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SMEARGLE marks the boundaries of its territory using a body fluid that leaks out from the tip of its tail. Over 5,000 different marks left by this POKéMON have been found."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A SMEARGLE marks its territory using a fluid that leaks out from the tip of its tail. About 5,000 different marks left by this POKéMON have been found."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Once it becomes an adult, it has a tendency to let its comrades plant footprints on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"A special fluid oozes from the tip of its tail. It paints the fluid everywhere to mark its territory."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"A special fluid oozes from the tip of its tail. It paints the fluid everywhere to mark its territory."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Once it becomes an adult, it has a tendency to let its comrades plant footprints on its back."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il marque son territoire en maniant sa queue comme un pinceau. On dénombre plus de 5 000 marques."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il marque son territoire en maniant sa queue comme un pinceau. On dénombre plus de 5 000 marques."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il marque son territoire en maniant sa queue comme un pinceau. On dénombre plus de 5 000 marques."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Marca su territorio usando su cola a modo de pincel. Ha hecho más de 5000 marcas diferentes."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"尻尾を 筆のように 使って 縄張りを マークで 描く。 その 種類は ５０００以上。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Arrivé à l’âge adulte, il laisse ses camarades poser leur empreinte de patte sur son dos."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando llega a adulto, suele dejar que sus camaradas dejen sus huellas sobre su lomo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Once it becomes an adult, it has a tendency to let its comrades plant footprints on its back."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大人になると 仲間から 背中に 足跡の マークを つけられる 習性を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Queulorior délimite son territoire en libérant un fluide corporel qui sort de sa queue. On a découvert plus de 5 000 traces différentes de fluide laissées par ce Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Smeargle marca los límites de su territorio liberando un fluido corporal por el extremo de la cola. En la actualidad se han encontrado más de 5000 tipos de marcas distintas dejadas por este Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Smeargle marks the boundaries of its territory using a body fluid that leaks out from the tip of its tail. Over 5,000 different marks left by this Pokémon have been found."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"尻尾の 先から にじみ出る 体液で 縄張りの 周りに 自分の マークを 描く。 ５０００ 種類の マークが 見つかっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Queulorior délimite son territoire en libérant un fluide corporel qui sort de sa queue. On a découvert plus de 5 000 traces différentes de fluide laissées par ce Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Smeargle marca los límites de su territorio liberando un fluido corporal por el extremo de la cola. En la actualidad se han encontrado más de 5000 tipos de marcas distintas dejadas por este Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Smeargle marks the boundaries of its territory using a body fluid that leaks out from the tip of its tail. Over 5,000 different marks left by this Pokémon have been found."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"尻尾の 先から にじみ出る 体液で 縄張りの 周りに 自分の マークを 描く。 ５０００ 種類の マークが 見つかっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ce Pokémon marque son territoire en peignant à l’aide du liquide suintant du bout de sa queue."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Smeargle marca los límites de su territorio dibujando marcas personales con el fluido que libera por la punta de la cola."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"The unique creations produced by each Smeargle are painted using the fluid that oozes from its tail. This is how it marks its territory."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"シッポの 先から にじみでてくる 体液で 独自の マークを 描いて 縄張りを アピール。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ce Pokémon peint pour marquer son territoire. On reconnaît les villes peuplées de nombreux Queulorior à leurs murs recouverts de graffitis."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Los muros de las ciudades donde viven Smeargle están llenos de las marcas que van dejando para indicar los límites de su territorio."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It draws symbols all over the place to mark its territory. In towns with many Smeargle, the walls are covered in graffiti."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"自分の 縄張りを 示す マークを 描き散らすので ドーブルの 多い 街の 壁は 落書き だらけ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La teinte du liquide qui coule de sa queue varie en fonction de son humeur."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La tonalidad del líquido que libera por la cola cambia en función de su estado anímico."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The fluid of Smeargle’s tail secretions changes in the intensity of its hue as the Pokémon’s emotions change."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"シッポの 先から でる 体液は ドーブルの 感情に よって 色合いが 変化 するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il se sert du liquide qui sort de sa queue pour dessiner sa marque. Ses fans s’arrachent ses plus beaux tracés à prix d’or."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Dibuja marcas con el líquido que secreta por la cola. Algunos de sus admiradores han llegado a pagar auténticas fortunas por ellas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It draws symbols with the fluid that oozes from the tip of its tail. Depending on the symbol, Smeargle fanatics will pay big money for them."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"シッポの 先から でる 体